sequenceDiagram
    actor Student
    participant UI as web/index.html
    participant Server as web/server.py
    participant Compiler as ./errorbuddy
    Student->>UI: open http://localhost:8795
    UI->>Server: GET /api/examples
    Server-->>UI: example programs from examples/
    Student->>UI: type or pick an example
    UI->>UI: wait 350 ms after the last key
    UI->>Server: POST /api/compile with source
    Server->>Server: reject over 64 KB, write temp file
    Server->>Compiler: run temp file with --tokens, 5 s timeout
    Compiler-->>Server: stdout text and exit code
    Server->>Server: regex the text into tokens, error, tac, symbols, phases
    Server-->>UI: JSON result
    UI-->>Student: highlight error line, phase strip, TAC or suggestion
